<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? We discovered\nsomething about the Egg!\rMy assistant is at the Pokémon Center\nin Violet City.\fCould you talk to him?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bonjour!\nYou are Trainer?\rBattle Gym Leader, win you did? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ooh, la la!\nVery indeed nice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Is that so? Then study shall you!\fFollow me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here, teacher I am.\nGood it is you study here!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There have been reports of Ghost-type\nPokémon appearing in Sprout Tower.\rThey say Normal-type Pokémon moves\nhave no effect on them.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey, you’re a Trainer?\rThe old gym here is a League\npractice hall now. A visiting\finstructor runs pre-badge\nassessments.\fPerfect warm-up before Azalea\ngives you the real thing.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner, who led the old Violet\ngym, inherited it from his father.\rHe’s moved on--flown all the way\nto Fortree, if you can believe the\fdistance. The world got small.\rThe arena is the university’s\npractice hall now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You cannot have your Pokémon out\nwalking with you in some places.\rPlaces like buildings, caves, and\nwhere there are huge crowds.\rBut all you have to do is to put it in\na Poké Ball!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet City\nJohto’s University City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">League Practice Hall\rVisiting-instructor sessions and\npre-badge assessments today.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sprout Tower\rExperience the Way of Pokémon\nto Cast Aside Your Doubts.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Violet University Pokémon School\rDean: Earl\n“Many ways, one craft.”</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KIMONO GIRL: So it is you.\rForgive me. I have been watching\nsince you came up the road.\fWatching is rather what we do.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KIMONO GIRL: Old currents are\nstirring in Johto. The forest\fmurmurs of it. The bells hum it.\rAnd they hush, just a little,\nwhen you pass.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KIMONO GIRL: What that means, I do\nnot yet know. Nor do my sisters.\rSo walk your road with steady\nhands, and let us keep watching.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KIMONO GIRL: We will speak again,\nwhere the bells are older.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shard de Berry!\nShard de Berry!\rYah, yah!\nI trade Berry for a Shard.\rIf ya bring me some Shards,\nI will give ya three Berries, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shard de Berry!\nShard de Berry!\rYah, yah!\nI trade Berry for Shard.\rIf ya bring me some Shards,\nI will give ya three Berries, yah.\rWhich Shard will ya trade for\nde Berry? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">More Shards to trade for\nde Berries? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yah, yah!\nCome back when ya’ve changed\fya mind, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give ya de Berry set A\nfor de Red Shard, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give ya de Berry set B\nfor de Blue Shard, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give ya de Berry set C\nfor de Yellow Shard, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll give ya de Berry set D\nfor de Green Shard, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ya already have many Berries\nof dis set.\rCome back when ya need more, yah.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We care about the traditional buildings\naround here. That’s why even the\fPoké Mart and Pokémon Center are\fpainted a bit somberly to blend in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you know that Pokégear allows you\nto put marks and memos on its Map?\rI’d love to have one of those\nPokégears, but my mom won’t let me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EARL: Hah! New faces, road-dust\nstill on them! Yes! Earl I am!\fDean I am also! Welcome, welcome,\nnew road scholars!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EARL: Once a little school this\nwas. Now? A UNIVERSITY. For\ftraining is a craft, and a craft\ndeserves scholarship!\rViolet teaches many ways. Books\nfor the mind. The court for the\fbody. The tower, for the spirit.\rCenter and Mart, that way--heal,\nrestock, then go and LEARN.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EARL: See the tower first, I\nthink. Old Sprout Tower, where the\fsages train as they have for\ncenturies.\rThen come find me at the practice\nhall. A visitor we have--a real\fgym leader--and she does not stay\nforever.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Did he just say a REAL gym\nleader is here?\rOkay, change of plans, we are\ndoing everything he said in that\fexact order. Tower, then gym lady.\nMove!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SAGE: The whole tower SWAYED!\nDecades of discipline and a CHILD\fset our BELLSPROUT panicking for\na laugh!\rThe doors are shut to university\nstudents until this is made right!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EARL: Ren. REN. Again it is Ren.\nTalent he has, sense he has NOT.\rGo with me on this. Mediate. The\nboy will come--I insist, and I am,\foccasionally, insistent.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REN: It was not vandalism! It\nwas... UNAUTHORIZED FIELD\fPLACEMENT. Of some tags. Around a\ntower. That, in hindsight, sways.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: ...Okay, in fairness, I\nDID dare him. But I thought he’d\fchicken out! That’s the whole\npoint of a dare!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REN: She said the tower needed\nmore excitement. I may have\fsupplied too much excitement.\rLook--I’ll fix it. I just don’t\nknow how to fix it POLITELY.\fThat’s not my event.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SAGE: Mediator, are you? Then go\nup. Return what was misplaced,\fand battle us with steadier hands.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SAGE: The tower bends. Today, it\nalso forgives.\rClimb whenever your hands are\nsteady, young one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REN: So. You smoothed it over.\nWith MONKS. I didn’t think that\fwas a thing a person could do.\rHere--practical stuff, for the\nroad. Berries. They’ll patch a\fstatus when you’re out of fancier\noptions.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REN: You’re not boring. That’s\nrare around here, you have no\fidea.\rGo win your gym. I’ll be off\nfinding the next thing I shouldn’t\fdo. Maybe I’ll even do it QUIETLY\nthis time. ...No. Probably not.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EARL: Yes! Earl I am! Dean I am\nalso!\rBooks for mind, court for body,\ntower for spirit. Go and LEARN!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REN: The Elder said--get this--\n“A trainer who cannot wait will\feventually be taught by\nparalysis.”\rI’m going to be hearing that in my\nsleep. In HIS voice.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I did Roxanne’s thing\nwhile you were busy being a tower\fdiplomat. Passed, obviously.\rWhich means it’s time. You and me.\nFirst official battle.\rNo wild Pokémon, no rescue panic,\nno Gold hovering with a lecture\fface. Just us, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I grabbed CYNDAQUIL back\nin Cherrygrove SPECIFICALLY\fbecause it beats CHIKORITA.\rI’ve been waiting this whole route\nto prove that was smart.\fDon’t you DARE go easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I grabbed TOTODILE back\nin Cherrygrove SPECIFICALLY\fbecause it beats CYNDAQUIL.\rI’ve been waiting this whole route\nto prove that was smart.\fDon’t you DARE go easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I grabbed CHIKORITA back\nin Cherrygrove SPECIFICALLY\fbecause it beats TOTODILE.\rI’ve been waiting this whole route\nto prove that was smart.\fDon’t you DARE go easy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: Okay. OKAY. You’re better\nthan me today. TODAY.\rThat’s the most fun I’ve had since\nwe met, and I’ve been a Trainer\ffor like a week.\rHow is this our LIFE now,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0556_T22_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KESTRA: I’m going ahead to Azalea--\nadvance research, very serious,\fabsolutely not a head start.\rRoute 32 south, then Union Cave--\nbring a light and some Potions,\fit’s a real one.\rThere’s an old fishing guru on the\nroute who’ll set you up.\rSee you at the gym, hero.\nDon’t keep me waiting!</language>
	</row>
</body>
